# Read from the repository root for BOTH Vercel projects (the app at the
# repo root, and the marketing site whose Root Directory is `marketing`).
# So nothing here may exclude `marketing/` — doing that stripped the
# marketing site's own source out of its deployment, leaving Vercel to
# build the app and then fail looking for `marketing/.next`.
/scripts
/tests
/docs
/storage
*.dmg
desktop/src-tauri/target
desktop/scripts/node_modules
